---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Learn more about the author of this blog."
	pubDate={new Date()}
>
	<p>
		My name is Sebastian Alvarez, I'm software engineer and technology enthusiast. I have a passion for writing about what I learn and sharing my knowledge with others. This blog is a place where I document my journey in the world of technology, programming, and software development. Adding writeups about ctf challenges I solve as well.
	</p>

	<p>
		I started this blog as a way to improve my writing skills and to create a portfolio of my work. Also I like to solve problems and challenges, so I decided to include writeups of the CTF challenges I solve. I believe that writing about what I learn helps me to solidify my understanding of the concepts and also helps others who may be facing similar challenges.
	</p>

	<p>
		I also like to solve algirithm and data structure problems on platforms like LeetCode and HackerRank. I find that these problems help me to improve my problem-solving skills and also keep my mind sharp. I plan to include writeups of the problems I solve on this blog as well.
	</p>

	<p>
		When I'm not writing or coding, I enjoy playing chess, watching anime, watching series, and exploring new technologies. I'm always looking for new ways to learn and grow, both personally and professionally.
	</p>
</Layout>
